 "remarks": "Lovely 5 bedroom, 4 bath storybook colonial with lots of charm and character. An open foyer leads to the spacious living room with a gas fireplace and built-ins, a formal dining room and a sun-lit family room with French doors and a second fireplace. The kitchen includes a large eat-in area with a pantry and a mudroom by the back entry. Also included on the first floor is a bedroom and bath, perfect for guests, in-laws or an au pair. On the second floor is a generous primary bedroom and bath, as well as 3 additional bedrooms, an office (or bedroom) and 2 full baths. The flat backyard is perfect for play and entertaining. Wonderful opportunity to live close to town, schools, Waveny Park and the YMCA!",
